      "id": 1,
      "text": "Rougemont’s name comes from French “Rouge Mont,” meaning Red Mountain, after the town’s reddish clay hills.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
